The filings described in this dataset belong to the regulators that published them:
the National Highway Traffic Safety Administration (United States), Transport Canada,
and the European Commission Safety Gate. Their terms apply to their own material.

The matching between registers, the normalisation of the manufacturer codes, the
comparison and the assembled dataset are the work of carsmultiverse.com and are
released under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International Licence (CC BY 4.0).

You may share and adapt this material, including commercially, provided you give
attribution to carsmultiverse.com.

